### ✅ 2. Use this pod name in targeted health queries

Now try this for readiness:

```prometheus
kube_pod_container_status_ready{
  pod="storefront-api-ut-00060-deployment-77488b567f-9s4pf",
  namespace="storefront-storefront-ut"
}
```

And for restart count:

```prometheus
kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{
  pod="storefront-api-ut-00060-deployment-77488b567f-9s4pf",
  namespace="storefront-storefront-ut"
}
```

And for start time:

```prometheus
kube_pod_start_time{
  pod="storefront-api-ut-00060-deployment-77488b567f-9s4pf",
  namespace="storefront-storefront-ut"
}
```

